1
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:06,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>江户城御庭番众密探 般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:06,589 --> 00:00:10,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>奉首领之命 死守此处！</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:11,094 --> 00:00:13,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下想尽量避免不必要的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:16,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>你可以让开吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:18,893
<c.simplifiedchinese>首领的命令是绝对的</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:21,938 --> 00:00:26,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋 在皮手套下面装了铁护手</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:26,776 --> 00:00:32,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪不得那天能轻易接下剑心一招</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:33,658 --> 00:00:36,453
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来我们只能交手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:39,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>很抱歉 在下不会手下留情的</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:39,748 --> 00:00:42,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:44,919
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:01:00,769 --> 00:01:04,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:33,069 --> 00:02:34,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>直击？</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:35,363 --> 00:02:36,948
<c.simplifiedchinese>背拳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:47,333 --> 00:02:49,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么一直傻站着挨打？</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:49,544 --> 00:02:51,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点也不像你</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:51,170 --> 00:02:54,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>快用飞天御剑流看穿他的招式！</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:54,924 --> 00:02:56,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看穿了</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:57,552 --> 00:02:59,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看穿了他的直拳和背拳</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:59,971 --> 00:03:02,348
<c.simplifiedchinese>按理说在下能刚好躲开</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:03:02,432 --> 00:03:06,936
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他的手臂却在一瞬间变长了</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:09,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:12,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的实力应该不止如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:12,233 --> 00:03:15,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你破不了我的秘术</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:18,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>你跟首领交手都撑不过一分钟</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:18,698 --> 00:03:19,574
<c.simplifiedchinese>秘术？</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:20,408 --> 00:03:22,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>一周前</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:22,243 --> 00:03:28,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>从你看到我的那一刻起
就已经中了我的秘术</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:28,625 --> 00:03:31,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>在你不知不觉的时候</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:36,758 --> 00:03:38,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>好像开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:40,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若不好对付</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:40,678 --> 00:03:43,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不仅是卓越的拳法家</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:43,806 --> 00:03:46,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>还使用必杀技伸腕之术</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:47,018 --> 00:03:49,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>除非看穿秘术的奥秘</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:49,604 --> 00:03:51,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则毫无胜算</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:51,648 --> 00:03:53,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:53,149 --> 00:03:55,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>是秘术啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:55,526 --> 00:03:59,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然有点麻烦 但是必须先解决它</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:03,952 --> 00:04:06,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 那是什么架势？</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:06,663 --> 00:04:07,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:08,623 --> 00:04:11,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然很像五行架势中的正眼</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:12,001 --> 00:04:13,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>又明显不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:14,462 --> 00:04:16,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>信剑架势</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:17,131 --> 00:04:19,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>双臂水平向前举起刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:19,467 --> 00:04:23,179
<c.simplifiedchinese>直指对手眉间</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:23,263 --> 00:04:26,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以随时根据对手的行动做出反应</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:27,016 --> 00:04:30,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>是古流剑术中的强力防守架势</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:31,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:32,063 --> 00:04:37,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>反过来说 也是难以转向攻势
只能防守的架势</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:37,735 --> 00:04:40,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是你的全部水平吗 拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:42,782 --> 00:04:43,783
<c.simplifiedchinese>回答我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:46,786 --> 00:04:48,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:48,663 --> 00:04:52,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>这男人就是传说中的刽子手吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:53,001 --> 00:04:56,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>我真蠢 竟高看了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:56,754 --> 00:05:01,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这种人没资格跟苍紫大人交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:01,968 --> 00:05:04,679
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在这就杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:04,762 --> 00:05:08,683
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论怎样采用怎样的防御架势</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:08,766 --> 00:05:12,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>看不破伸腕之术就不可能打败我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:18,192 --> 00:05:19,986
<c.simplifiedchinese>-躲开了
-他看破了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:23,865 --> 00:05:24,699
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:24,782 --> 00:05:26,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看破了吗 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:26,743 --> 00:05:27,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:28,328 --> 00:05:33,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>他秘术的奥秘就藏在
双臂上的横向条纹上</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>横向条纹？</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:36,461 --> 00:05:39,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白了 眼睛的错觉</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:39,297 --> 00:05:43,634
<c.simplifiedchinese>横向条纹让事物看起来
比实际上更短更宽</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:43,718 --> 00:05:46,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你被误导算错了距离</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:46,929 --> 00:05:50,558
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的手臂比目测的长一寸</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:51,601 --> 00:05:54,312
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个误差让人感觉手臂瞬间伸长</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:54,395 --> 00:05:58,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是本来能躲开却被击中的原因</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:58,274 --> 00:06:01,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:01,110 --> 00:06:07,825
<c.simplifiedchinese>摆出信剑的架势
利用刀刃来测量误差！</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:07,909 --> 00:06:09,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:09,619 --> 00:06:13,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑客对自己爱刀的长度了如指掌</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:13,247 --> 00:06:15,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此可以把刀当作测量的尺子</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:21,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一次见到你
在下就对你的奇怪装束产生了疑问</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:21,589 --> 00:06:27,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是双臂上的条纹太过显眼
作为密探多有不利</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:27,303 --> 00:06:31,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而条纹对于拳法家来说却是优点</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:31,099 --> 00:06:34,477
<c.simplifiedchinese>此外 面具遮盖了你的眼神和表情</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你的动作更难看穿</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:37,688 --> 00:06:39,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的对</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:40,024 --> 00:06:43,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过 这个般若面具隐藏的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:44,028 --> 00:06:47,907
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅这些</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:59,293 --> 00:07:00,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪物…</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:01,212 --> 00:07:03,089
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪物？</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:04,006 --> 00:07:08,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>这张脸自有便利之处</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:08,553 --> 00:07:09,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:10,012 --> 00:07:11,597
<c.simplifiedchinese>对自己做了什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:12,265 --> 00:07:14,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是密探</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:15,059 --> 00:07:18,354
<c.simplifiedchinese>最重要的任务是收集情报</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:18,438 --> 00:07:23,818
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了隐藏相貌 我烧毁了双唇</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:23,901 --> 00:07:28,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>割下了耳朵和鼻子 磨掉了颧骨</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:32,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道你在哪里出生</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:32,869 --> 00:07:36,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我出生的地方 有许多贫穷的村子</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:37,039 --> 00:07:38,624
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些村子里</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:38,708 --> 00:07:40,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>至今还存在着</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:40,543 --> 00:07:44,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>养不起孩子的父母
杀掉自己骨肉的风俗</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:44,547 --> 00:07:48,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>我出生的村子把这叫做“还子”</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:48,384 --> 00:07:50,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:51,053 --> 00:07:55,975
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算勉强活下来
也没法回到原来的家庭</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:56,058 --> 00:07:59,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>从此只能像猫狗一样徘徊</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:59,437 --> 00:08:03,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>像孤狼一样杀人掠夺</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:04,233 --> 00:08:06,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过！</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:07,069
<c.simplifiedchinese>钩爪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:07,153 --> 00:08:11,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫大人收留了像孤狼一样的我</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:11,949 --> 00:08:15,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>把我培养成了一流密探！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:15,119 --> 00:08:18,289
<c.simplifiedchinese>还给了我江户城御庭番众的身份</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:18,372 --> 00:08:21,626
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我有了伙伴和生存的意义</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:21,709 --> 00:08:27,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要能帮上苍紫大人
脸和性命对我来说又有什么用！</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:27,673 --> 00:08:29,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>小心 剑心！他疯了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>他为了首领</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:32,386 --> 00:08:34,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了御庭番众赌上一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:34,138 --> 00:08:36,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>是真正的怪物！</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:38,351 --> 00:08:40,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若 回答我一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:40,311 --> 00:08:44,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>你了解惠小姐的过去吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:44,190 --> 00:08:45,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>别惹我发笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:49,946
<c.simplifiedchinese>这世界上没有御庭番众不知道的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:09,549 --> 00:09:10,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>不行啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:10,925 --> 00:09:15,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这样根本碰不到苍紫大人一根手指</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:23,521 --> 00:09:25,565
<c.simplifiedchinese>总算打倒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:25,648 --> 00:09:27,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是难缠的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:28,901 --> 00:09:29,735
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:30,778 --> 00:09:34,532
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明你比别人更清楚孤独的痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:35,366 --> 00:09:38,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么不能同情惠小姐的遭遇呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:40,788 --> 00:09:42,206
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:43,165 --> 00:09:45,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐还在等我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:45,585 --> 00:09:46,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:56,262 --> 00:09:58,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠 你听到了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:59,557 --> 00:10:00,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠！</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:00,474 --> 00:10:02,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吵</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:02,351 --> 00:10:04,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么不打开门锁自己进来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:04,812 --> 00:10:07,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>钥匙被苍紫拿走了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:07,732 --> 00:10:09,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>事到如今你还想干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:09,692 --> 00:10:12,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>是我错了 我道歉</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:13,029 --> 00:10:17,199
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想办法找到钥匙
然后我们俩一起逃走！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:17,283 --> 00:10:20,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道一条别人不知道的秘道</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:20,578 --> 00:10:21,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:21,996 --> 00:10:24,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟你逃跑对我有什么好处？</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:24,123 --> 00:10:26,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们什么都做得到</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:26,167 --> 00:10:27,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>用你的知识和技术</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:27,918 --> 00:10:31,881
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我的商业才能开发一种新药</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:31,964 --> 00:10:34,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们可以拯救被病痛折磨的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:35,384 --> 00:10:38,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在反省了…不 深刻反省了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:38,471 --> 00:10:42,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>我为对你和社会做的事感到懊悔</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:42,308 --> 00:10:47,146
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们背负着同样的罪孽
我现在想跟你重新开始</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:47,229 --> 00:10:50,232
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为我爱你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:51,692 --> 00:10:53,778
<c.simplifiedchinese>随便你去哪 观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:53,861 --> 00:10:56,072
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的鬼话我听得够多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:56,656 --> 00:10:59,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没法赎清罪孽了</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:59,867 --> 00:11:04,789
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我唯一能做的就是阻止鸦片传播</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:04,872 --> 00:11:05,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>仅此而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:07,208 --> 00:11:09,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们地狱再见吧 观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:13,005 --> 00:11:14,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:14,298 --> 00:11:16,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>唯一的罪人只有你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:16,467 --> 00:11:19,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>制造鸦片错的是你</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:19,303 --> 00:11:21,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>不做鸦片错的也是你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:22,556 --> 00:11:24,183
<c.simplifiedchinese>我什么都没干</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:24,266 --> 00:11:28,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>你个恶女毒妇婊子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:28,813 --> 00:11:30,356
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:30,439 --> 00:11:32,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就一个人在那歉疚吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:32,525 --> 00:11:36,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>想想被你害死的人的感受</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:43,828
<c.simplifiedchinese>人渣</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:47,248 --> 00:11:48,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的伤还好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:48,791 --> 00:11:50,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤口不深</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:50,543 --> 00:11:52,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>血已经止住了</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:56,882 --> 00:11:57,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:57,883 --> 00:12:02,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若那么崇拜的四乃森苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:02,388 --> 00:12:05,516
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟是怎样的男人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:10,187 --> 00:12:14,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>能到这里 说明你们已经打败了般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:16,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>干得不错嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:16,735 --> 00:12:21,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>江户城御庭番众内城守卫 式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:21,115 --> 00:12:22,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>以此为见面礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:22,783 --> 00:12:23,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>再来一次！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:25,953 --> 00:12:26,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:26,996 --> 00:12:31,292
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个肌肉笨蛋交给我 你们先走</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:31,375 --> 00:12:34,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种家伙我很快就能收拾掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:34,837 --> 00:12:37,381
<c.simplifiedchinese>快把那个乖戾女人救出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:37,465 --> 00:12:39,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:40,092 --> 00:12:42,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我们走 弥彦
-好</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:49,518 --> 00:12:53,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一开始就打算放剑心过去吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:53,439 --> 00:12:55,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:59,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>把最厉害的让给首领是惯例</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:02,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>本大爷要忍受三流的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:02,364 --> 00:13:03,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>打手斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:05,826 --> 00:13:07,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>很惊讶吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:07,411 --> 00:13:10,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若全都调查过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:14,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在黑道还算挺有名的</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:19,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过现在没了斩马刀 你什么都不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:20,633 --> 00:13:23,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>别搞错了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:23,093 --> 00:13:24,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没有斩马刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:24,803 --> 00:13:28,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>但能自由挥动斩马刀的双臂还健在</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:28,933 --> 00:13:32,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>要忍受三流对手的是我才对！</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:36,440
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:36,524 --> 00:13:38,651
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助一个人可以吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:38,734 --> 00:13:40,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙好像很厉害…</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:41,028 --> 00:13:43,614
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左会没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:43,697 --> 00:13:47,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算我们跟他在一起
他也不会让人插手的</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:48,118 --> 00:13:49,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>要撞门了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:49,745 --> 00:13:50,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>抓好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:50,412 --> 00:13:51,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>（舞厅）</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:55,084 --> 00:14:00,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢说守卫主城的本大爷是三流？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:01,090 --> 00:14:04,885
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们用各自引以为傲的双拳</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:04,969 --> 00:14:07,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>来进行对决如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:08,764
<c.simplifiedchinese>正合我意！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:12,351 --> 00:14:15,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>你！不是说好只用拳头吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:15,145 --> 00:14:16,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>别慌</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:20,067 --> 00:14:22,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是这么用的</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:29,451 --> 00:14:32,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧 看谁才是三流货色</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:38,335 --> 00:14:39,795
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:40,629 --> 00:14:45,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>还算有骨气 不过选错了对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:46,218 --> 00:14:48,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:49,722 --> 00:14:53,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么擅自宣布胜利了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:53,434 --> 00:14:56,562
<c.simplifiedchinese>这算什么战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:56,645 --> 00:14:58,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么双拳对决？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:58,647 --> 00:14:59,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:00,065 --> 00:15:04,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>真男人打架从来不用这种小玩意</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:05,362 --> 00:15:08,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>别用你那破玩具当武器了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:09,783 --> 00:15:12,161
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 这样好多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:12,244 --> 00:15:14,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样可以使出全力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:14,496 --> 00:15:16,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不错！
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:16,123 --> 00:15:19,668
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那番大话说得不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:19,752 --> 00:15:23,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>你确实不是普通的三流货色</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:23,088 --> 00:15:26,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>说谁是三流货色 蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:30,596 --> 00:15:32,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>不错…</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:33,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过！</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:39,688 --> 00:15:41,732
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 对不住</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:41,815 --> 00:15:44,318
<c.simplifiedchinese>没忍住用了头槌</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:44,944 --> 00:15:47,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你看到的这满身伤疤</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:47,613 --> 00:15:51,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>本大爷的人生一直在战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:51,283 --> 00:15:54,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没思考完身体就先做出反应了</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:56,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:57,581 --> 00:15:59,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:59,249 --> 00:16:03,170
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的头骨没被头槌砸碎 很了不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:03,253 --> 00:16:05,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>但里面的情况可不一定</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:16:05,881 --> 00:16:08,217
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的大脑受到了冲击</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:11,679
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在应该一根手指都动不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:16:12,304 --> 00:16:13,555
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:16:13,639 --> 00:16:16,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>本大爷的手也被你打麻了</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:16:17,184 --> 00:16:18,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢你 小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:19,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:19,937 --> 00:16:24,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>忘了拔刀斋 做我们的伙伴吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:24,525 --> 00:16:25,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:25,526 --> 00:16:28,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不在乎出身</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:28,862 --> 00:16:31,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要实力够强就可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:31,281 --> 00:16:36,203
<c.simplifiedchinese>本大爷本来是萨摩藩的密探</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:36,286 --> 00:16:40,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是维新志士那边的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>庆应二年</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:47,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>我为了探听决战信息潜入江户城</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:47,631 --> 00:16:51,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>被当时只有13岁的首领打败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:52,094 --> 00:16:57,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>你拥有超出常人的肌肉力量
杀了你太可惜</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:57,307 --> 00:17:03,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果用御庭番众的秘药增强肌肉力量
你会变得更强</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:08,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>做我们的伙伴吧 这样你就无敌了</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:09,528 --> 00:17:10,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>无敌？</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:16,744
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后我就获得了无敌的肌肉</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:16,827 --> 00:17:18,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:18,537 --> 00:17:22,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有变得更强的潜力</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:22,124 --> 00:17:24,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你用了御庭番众的秘药</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:24,251 --> 00:17:27,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>实力也许可以超过般若和本大爷</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:31,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你说的是真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:35,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>四乃森苍紫是个相当厉害的高手</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:35,137 --> 00:17:36,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:36,513 --> 00:17:40,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果首领去京都对抗维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:40,267 --> 00:17:46,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么最强传说将不是拔刀斋
而是首领</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:46,607 --> 00:17:49,234
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众很强</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:49,318 --> 00:17:55,991
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就不用说了
恶见、火男也是不能轻视的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:56,075 --> 00:17:57,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:58,035 --> 00:17:59,745
<c.simplifiedchinese>仅此而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:00,329 --> 00:18:07,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>四乃森苍紫的身边都是高手
但也仅此而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:07,294 --> 00:18:09,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>你究竟想说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:09,838 --> 00:18:14,093
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们一个个除了厉害没有别的</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:14,176 --> 00:18:19,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此高手聚在一起时
变强和战斗成了你们的一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:19,807 --> 00:18:22,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>但绯村剑心不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:22,601 --> 00:18:26,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘 弥彦 甚至高荷惠…</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:26,730 --> 00:18:30,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>他身边聚集的全是爱着他的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:30,275 --> 00:18:33,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手的身份成为过去
现在作为一名浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:33,779 --> 00:18:37,491
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的身边仍然纷争不断</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:38,242 --> 00:18:39,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>然而…</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:39,618 --> 00:18:43,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底想说什么 小子？</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:45,374 --> 00:18:47,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有人都知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:53,340
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论有多强
剑心都不是为自己而挥舞刀剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:53,423 --> 00:18:54,299
<c.simplifiedchinese>你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:54,383 --> 00:18:55,634
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:55,717 --> 00:19:00,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的逆刃刀只为保护别人而存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:00,472 --> 00:19:05,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们御庭番众沉醉于自己的实力
甘心做武田观柳的走狗</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:05,936 --> 00:19:09,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本比不上绯村剑心的器量！</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:09,148 --> 00:19:11,358
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:11,441 --> 00:19:14,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>夸你几句还自大起来了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:15,028 --> 00:19:16,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:16,530 --> 00:19:20,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说谁沉醉实力？</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:20,993 --> 00:19:25,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>对你手下留情你还得寸进尺了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:26,039 --> 00:19:27,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>要说大话</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:19:27,875 --> 00:19:31,962
<c.simplifiedchinese>打败式尉大爷之后再说吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:19:32,045 --> 00:19:33,964
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是我说的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:34,047 --> 00:19:36,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>沉醉于自己的实力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:36,842 --> 00:19:38,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:44,558 --> 00:19:47,102
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了 三流货色</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:53,734 --> 00:19:57,905
<c.simplifiedchinese>“就算你的头骨再硬
但头骨里面可不一定”</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:58,572 --> 00:20:00,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:02,951 --> 00:20:04,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:04,494 --> 00:20:08,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果有机会去跟剑心交手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:09,416 --> 00:20:15,088
<c.simplifiedchinese>说不定能找回你失去的宝贵东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:19,009 --> 00:20:25,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>是说 御庭番众到底还有几个人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:25,432 --> 00:20:29,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>继续这样打下去…</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:29,603 --> 00:20:30,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的身体…</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:34,524 --> 00:20:40,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然认得彼此的样子
但这是我们第一次交谈</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:40,781 --> 00:20:41,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:41,698 --> 00:20:45,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下想要避免不必要的争斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:20:46,078 --> 00:20:50,374
<c.simplifiedchinese>你愿意让开
并告诉我观柳和惠的位置吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:20:51,124 --> 00:20:53,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>你对般若这么说的时候
他让开了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>没让开吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:59,258 --> 00:21:02,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>用你的逆刃刀来问他们俩的下落吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:21:04,388 --> 00:21:07,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>我用这把刀来回答</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:22:45,030 --> 00:22:48,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《首领 四乃森苍紫》</c.simplifiedchinese>

